<div class="scp-image-block block-right" style="width:45%;"><a href="/local--files/scp-2522/hatbot1.png" target="_blank"><img src="http://scp-wiki.wdfiles.com/local--files/scp-2522/hatbot1.png" style="width:45%;" alt="hatbot1.png" class="image" /></a>
