<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-2"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-2')">2</a>. Reverse engineered from an <em><a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/anderson-robotics-hub">Anderson Robotics</a></em> model.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-3"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-3')">3</a>. All of which occurred at locations hosting free wifi to the public.</div>
<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-4"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-4')">4</a>. This rate is not consistent, and has been erratic at times since first appearing.</div>
